OL,3,ARussian double-tap drone strike kills
OL,4,A16 in Ukrainian mall, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 16 people have been killed in
OL,7,Fa Russian double-tap drone strike on a
OL,8,Fshopping centre in the central
OL,9,FUkrainian city of Kryvyi Rih, local
OL,10,Fofficials have said.
OL,12,FAnother 130 people - including 23
OL,13,Fchildren - were injured in the attack
OL,14,Fon city's biggest mall. More people are
OL,15,Falso reported to be trapped in the
OL,16,Frubble.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
