OL,3,ARussian double-tap drone strike kills
OL,4,A16 in Ukrainian mall, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,7,F"absolutely cynical and despicable"
OL,8,Fdaytime attack in his home town was
OL,9,Fcarried out in "two waves", with the
OL,10,Fsecond strike targeting emergency
OL,11,Fworkers at the scene.
OL,13,FDramatic footage verified by the BBC
OL,14,Fshows the second drone hitting the
OL,15,Falready burning shopping centre in the
OL,16,FDnipropetrovsk region. Russia's
OL,17,Fmilitary has not commented.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
